.TH CCFLEET 1 "2026-11-18" "atelier instruments" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ccfleet \- run headless Claude Code sessions across a fleet of repos, each
billed to its own repo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ccfleet
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR path ]
.RB [ \-\-by
.IR id ]
.B check
.br
.B ccfleet
.RI [ common ]
.B gate
.br
.B ccfleet
